# Rust build output. Regenerated by `cargo build`; hundreds of MB.
/target/
# Tauri writes this on first build from tauri.conf.json.
/gen/schemas/

# `tauri icon` generates Android and iOS launcher sets alongside the desktop
# ones. §7.3 is explicit that mobile stays on the PWA -- "start with the PWA
# and stop there unless it's genuinely inadequate" -- so there is no Tauri
# mobile target here and these 30 files would be committed for a platform this
# project has decided not to build. Regenerate with `npx tauri icon` if that
# ever changes.
/icons/android/
/icons/ios/
